{"id":"75ee183e94958e96","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-fine-structure.md","title":"Fine Structure Theory","display":"thm-fine-structure — Fine Structure Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-fine-structure","aliases":["58-thm-fine-structure","Fine Structure Theory","Jensen Hierarchy"],"display":"thm-fine-structure — Fine Structure Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-fine-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-fine-structure</span><span>Fine Structure Theory</span><span>Jensen Hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fine-structure — Fine Structure Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2331ede3868d950e\" href=\"?note=2331ede3868d950e\" title=\"../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md\">../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31fb1fed988b718a\" href=\"?note=31fb1fed988b718a\" title=\"../batch17/58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics.md\">../batch17/58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"10c90675676572c7\" href=\"?note=10c90675676572c7\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"923d94bd12fb8dd3\" href=\"?note=923d94bd12fb8dd3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\\)</span> (Jensen hierarchy stage)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,J_\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,J_\\alpha)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,X,J_\\beta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,X,J_\\beta)\\)</span> (Mostowski collapse map)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha,X,J_\\alpha,J\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\\land X\\subseteq J_\\alpha\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak X,\\mathfrak J_\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,J_\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha+1\\;\\exists J_\\beta,\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\beta,J_\\beta,J)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,X,J_\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fine\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha,X,J_\\alpha,J\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\\land X\\subseteq J_\\alpha\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak X,\\mathfrak J_\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,J_\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak X,\\mathfrak J_\\alpha,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha+1\\;\\exists J_\\beta,\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\beta,J_\\beta,J)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,X,J_\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion concerns the transitive collapse of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, not literal equality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=J_\\beta\">\\(X=J_\\beta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Condensation is the structural input; projecta and master codes refine it to track definability at successive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>-levels.</li>\n<li>Without the elementary-substructure and hierarchy hypotheses, an arbitrary substructure need not collapse to a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>-level.</li>\n<li>Both membership structures and the collapse map are set-coded predicates; the earlier ordered-pair notation did not call the registered elementary-substructure predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2331ede3868d950e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics.md","status":"resolved","id":"31fb1fed988b718a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md","status":"resolved","id":"10c90675676572c7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"923d94bd12fb8dd3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":""